# LF in the repository AND in the worktree, on every platform, as in kama, kyoten, @kama/gpu and @kama/window. Without
# it a Windows checkout obeys `core.autocrlf` and lands every text file as CRLF, which breaks wherever bytes are compared
# rather than executed (golden images' digests, generated files), and a shell script with CRLF fails under a strict sh.
# Binary files are left alone.
* text=auto eol=lf
